(extension version)
	(collect $Closure)
		*(draconic extension version $Closure)
	(into $List)
	Draconis extensions :
	(listing $List {(query $_)} @and) %% And-listing
	.
%% Normally this is the one extension that never needs to be modified
%% But the Hittite library doesn’t have identical objects so the signature for (listing...) is different lmao
